.TH MYSTRLEN 3 "September 2026" "Version 0.4.1" "OS Assignment"
.SH NAME
mystrlen \- calculate the length of a string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "../include/mystrfunctions.h"
.br
.B int mystrlen(const char *s);
.SH DESCRIPTION
The mystrlen function calculates and returns the number of characters in the given string, excluding the terminating null character.
